event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":81,"item_id":"rs_095d33baf5f98842016acb9f0e5cf481969d3179f33f75be36","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering date validation**\n\nI'm focusing on implementing a plain date validator that checks for leap years and verifies date ranges, ensuring it can handle all cases without any specific date input. It seems important to make this thorough, including comprehensive test cases to catch any potential issues. I’ll want to append those tests once I have the base functionality working. Let's make sure this validator is robust and functions correctly under all scenarios!"}

